<section aria-labelledby="tecnologia-heading">

  <header>
    <h1 id="tecnologia-heading">Technology interests</h1>
    <p>Areas of computing and technology that particularly interest me during my education and professional development.</p>
  </header>

  <article aria-labelledby="desarrollo-heading">
    <header>
      <h2 id="desarrollo-heading">Software development</h2>
      <p>Programming and architecture</p>
    </header>
    <p>My main interest in computing is software development, especially creating robust, maintainable applications that are easy to evolve.</p>
    <p>I am particularly interested in Java and Spring Boot, API design, application architecture and good development practices such as Clean Architecture, SOLID principles and domain-driven design.</p>
  </article>

  <article aria-labelledby="infraestructura-heading">
    <header>
      <h2 id="infraestructura-heading">Systems and infrastructure</h2>
      <p>Servers and operations</p>
    </header>
    <p>I am also interested in the technologies used to run and maintain applications once they have been developed. I enjoy working with Linux systems, servers, networks and administration tools.</p>
    <p>Docker, virtual machines, scripting and service configuration particularly interest me because they connect software directly with infrastructure.</p>
  </article>

  <article aria-labelledby="redes-heading">
    <header>
      <h2 id="redes-heading">Networks and communications</h2>
      <p>Connectivity and services</p>
    </header>
    <p>Networks are another of my main interests, especially the way different systems and services communicate with each other.</p>
    <p>I am interested in understanding protocols, network services, addressing, security, firewalls and the layers that make reliable application deployment possible.</p>
  </article>

  <article aria-labelledby="seguridad-heading">
    <header>
      <h2 id="seguridad-heading">Cybersecurity</h2>
      <p>Protecting systems</p>
    </header>
    <p>I consider cybersecurity an essential, cross-cutting concern in the development and deployment of any system.</p>
    <p>I am particularly interested in protecting web services, secure server configuration, HTTPS, certificate management and measures that reduce an infrastructure's attack surface.</p>
  </article>
</section>